==Battleground==
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Midrange units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] can be used to take out shorter range enemies. Melee and Tanker units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] can be used to take out Master A.

